# Text is checked out with LF on every platform. The renderer's tests read shaders and other sources with
# include_str! and match multi-line strings joined with "\n"; a CRLF checkout (Git for Windows' default
# core.autocrlf=true) fails them (#158).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, whatever git's heuristic says.
*.glb binary
*.jpg binary
*.mp4 binary
*.spv binary
*.tpg binary
*.webp binary
